[excerpt 4] Since its inception, the Company has devoted substantially all of its resources to building its Prime Editing platform and advancing development of its portfolio of programs, establishing and protecting its intellectual property, conducting research and development activities, organizing and staffing the company, business planning, raising capital and providing general and administrative support for these operations.

